### Health check
POST http://localhost:5001/v1/common/status
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Todo - create
POST http://localhost:5001/v1/todo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

{
  "task": "Pay water bill"
}

### Todo - list all
GET http://localhost:5001/v1/todo
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Todo - list by status (uses GSI)
GET http://localhost:5001/v1/todo/by-status?status=pending
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Todo - get one
GET http://localhost:5001/v1/todo/<TODO_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Todo - update
PATCH http://localhost:5001/v1/todo/<TODO_ID>
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

{
  "status": "completed"
}

### Todo - delete
DELETE http://localhost:5001/v1/todo/<TODO_ID>
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

### Order - create (producer -> SQS)
POST http://localhost:5001/v1/order
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ACCESS_TOKEN>

{
  "customerEmail": "user@example.com",
  "amount": 99.5
}

### Upload - presigned PUT URL
POST http://localhost:5001/v1/upload/presigned
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileName": "report.pdf",
  "contentType": "application/pdf"
}

### Upload - presigned GET URL
GET http://localhost:5001/v1/upload/uploads/<S3_KEY>